<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Tajawal:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/custom.css">
    <style>body { font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif; }</style>
    <title>تم التسجيل بنجاح</title>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen px-4">
    <div class="bg-white p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl text-center max-w-md w-full border-t-8 border-[#4AB76B] transform scale-100 transition-transform">
        <div class="text-6xl mb-4 animate-bounce">✅</div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-[#122A4E] mb-4">تم تسجيلك بنجاح!</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-2 font-medium">تم استلام طلب انخراطك (100 درهم).</p>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-6">سيتم مراجعة ملفك من طرف الإدارة وتفعيله قريباً.</p>
        
        <div class="w-full bg-gray-100 rounded-full h-2.5 mb-4 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="bg-[#4AB76B] h-2.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-[3000ms] w-0" id="progress"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-bold mb-6">جاري توجيهك للصفحة الرئيسية...</p>

        <div class="flex gap-2">
            <a href="/index.php" class="flex-1 bg-blue-900 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-800 transition">الرئيسية</a>
            <a href="/login.php" class="flex-1 bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 font-bold py-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-gray-200 transition">تسجيل الدخول</a>
        </div>

        <script>
            setTimeout(() => {
                const el = document.getElementById('progress');
                if (el) el.style.width = '100%';
            }, 100);
            setTimeout(() => {
                window.location.href = '/index.php';
            }, 4000);
        </script>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
